{"id":"d8fff134618bbd5c","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-functor-subcategory.md","title":"Full Functor Subcategories and Evaluation","display":"df-functor-subcategory — Full Functor Subcategories and Evaluation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-functor-subcategory","aliases":["58-df-functor-subcategory"],"display":"df-functor-subcategory — Full Functor Subcategories and Evaluation","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-functor-subcategory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-functor-subcategory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-functor-subcategory — Full Functor Subcategories and Evaluation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"970e2b8779070da0\" href=\"?note=970e2b8779070da0\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md\">../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal D,O,E,X\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal D,O,E,X\\in V\\)</span>；相关取值函数仅在所示范畴类型条件下使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_0=\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(F)\">\\(F_0=\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(F)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_1=\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(F)\">\\(F_1=\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(F)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta(X)\">\\(\\eta(X)\\)</span> 是自然变换分量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FunctorCodes}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FunctorCodes}_S\\)</span> 是二元函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FullFunctorSubcategory}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{FullFunctorSubcategory}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvaluationFunctor}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{EvaluationFunctor}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> 是下述定义的谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CatCompose}\">\\(\\mathrm{CatCompose}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CatIdentity}\">\\(\\mathrm{CatIdentity}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}\">\\(\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"970e2b8779070da0\" href=\"?note=970e2b8779070da0\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md\">../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}functor\\text{-}codes}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FunctorCodes}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal A)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle:\nF_0\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal A)^{\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\land\nF_1\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal A)^{\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)}\\land\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal A)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}functor\\text{-}codes}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FunctorCodes}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal A)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle:\nF_0\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal A)^{\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\land\nF_1\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal A)^{\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)}\\land\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal A)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}full\\text{-}functor\\text{-}subcategory}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FullFunctorSubcategory}_S(\\mathcal D,O,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal A)\n\\land O\\subseteq\\mathrm{FunctorCodes}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists M,s,t,c,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nM=\\{\\langle F,G,\\eta\\rangle:F,G\\in O\\land\\eta\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal A)^{\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\n\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land s=\\{\\langle\\langle F,G,\\eta\\rangle,F\\rangle:\\langle F,G,\\eta\\rangle\\in M\\}\n\\land t=\\{\\langle\\langle F,G,\\eta\\rangle,G\\rangle:\\langle F,G,\\eta\\rangle\\in M\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land e=\\left\\{\\left\\langle F,\n\\left\\langle F,F,\\{\\langle X,\\mathrm{CatIdentity}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(F)(X))\\rangle:X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\right\\rangle\\right\\rangle:F\\in O\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land c=\\left\\{\\left\\langle\n\\langle\\langle G,H,\\theta\\rangle,\\langle F,G,\\eta\\rangle\\rangle,\n\\left\\langle F,H,\\{\\langle X,\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal A,\\theta(X),\\eta(X))\\rangle:X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\right\\rangle\n\\right\\rangle:\\langle F,G,\\eta\\rangle,\\langle G,H,\\theta\\rangle\\in M\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}full\\text{-}functor\\text{-}subcategory}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FullFunctorSubcategory}_S(\\mathcal D,O,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal A)\n\\land O\\subseteq\\mathrm{FunctorCodes}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists M,s,t,c,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nM=\\{\\langle F,G,\\eta\\rangle:F,G\\in O\\land\\eta\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal A)^{\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\n\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land s=\\{\\langle\\langle F,G,\\eta\\rangle,F\\rangle:\\langle F,G,\\eta\\rangle\\in M\\}\n\\land t=\\{\\langle\\langle F,G,\\eta\\rangle,G\\rangle:\\langle F,G,\\eta\\rangle\\in M\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land e=\\left\\{\\left\\langle F,\n\\left\\langle F,F,\\{\\langle X,\\mathrm{CatIdentity}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(F)(X))\\rangle:X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\right\\rangle\\right\\rangle:F\\in O\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land c=\\left\\{\\left\\langle\n\\langle\\langle G,H,\\theta\\rangle,\\langle F,G,\\eta\\rangle\\rangle,\n\\left\\langle F,H,\\{\\langle X,\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal A,\\theta(X),\\eta(X))\\rangle:X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\right\\rangle\n\\right\\rangle:\\langle F,G,\\eta\\rangle,\\langle G,H,\\theta\\rangle\\in M\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}evaluation\\text{-}functor}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EvaluationFunctor}_S(E,X,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{FullFunctorSubcategory}_S(\\mathcal D,\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D),\\mathcal C,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land E=\\left\\langle\n\\{\\langle F,\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(F)(X)\\rangle:F\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\},\n\\{\\langle\\langle F,G,\\eta\\rangle,\\eta(X)\\rangle:\\langle F,G,\\eta\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal D)\\}\n\\right\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(E,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}evaluation\\text{-}functor}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EvaluationFunctor}_S(E,X,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{FullFunctorSubcategory}_S(\\mathcal D,\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D),\\mathcal C,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land E=\\left\\langle\n\\{\\langle F,\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(F)(X)\\rangle:F\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\},\n\\{\\langle\\langle F,G,\\eta\\rangle,\\eta(X)\\rangle:\\langle F,G,\\eta\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal D)\\}\n\\right\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(E,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>自然变换箭头带源函子与靶函子标签，避免同一个分量函数在不同对象对之间导致源靶不唯一。</li>\n<li>函子范畴的复合与单位均逐分量构造，不只指定对象集和箭头集而留下范畴运算任意。</li>\n<li>此文件供正文原有的层范畴、全局截面和站点上同调调用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md","status":"resolved","id":"970e2b8779070da0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{CatCompose}$、$\\mathrm{CatIdentity}$ 取 [[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"res